  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.LineaOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to Linea — a ConsenSys zkEVM L2 with MetaMask integration (chain ID 59144). Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and NFTs on Linea Mainnet. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture.\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Add verified Linea and Scroll native CQL demos (8746ec8)\n- Fix Linea CQL authority and encryption chain identity (10e5d86)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.LineaOASIS",
